olling Petra since she was a kid  she convinced Petra that her  ex-boyfriend Milo's wanted to end her  life for years Petra believes that  Milla's threw acid on her causing her  mother to get projected onto the street  where she was hit by a car this however  turned out to be karma as Magda had been  concocting a string of lies to keep  Petra wrapped around her finger  Magda pretended to be paralyzed from the  waist down for years so we were super  surprised when Magda stood up from her  wheelchair to push abuela down the  stairs this life-threatening event was  only the beginning though because once  Petra found out that her mother was  faking her disability to manipulate her  things between them were forever changed  just when I think you can't sink any  lower mother Magda would eventually go  to prison for crimes but that never  stopped her from meddling in Petra's  life although Rose has proven to be the  series big bad Magda tends to give her a  run for her money  problem is Magda isn't too smart and her  plans usually fail RIT Michael although  many of us have been rooting for Jane  and Rafael since the very beginning we  can't deny that Michael's a stand-up guy  the Jane the Virgin narrator had once  told us that Michael would love Jane  until his dying breath but we never  expected his demise to happen so  suddenly and out of the blue after  marrying Jane Michael is shot by sin  rostro and barely escaped with his life  he's told to take it easy and that he  should pursue another career path  Michael recovers but suddenly passes  away after suffering an aortic  dissection  after taking the LSAT exam Michaels  demise was thought to be the biggest  curveball of the series but nothing  compared to what we found out at the end  of season 4 Michael is still alive  that's right guys Michael is still alive  problem is he doesn't remember anything  about his past life according to Michael  he spent the last three years working on  a farm trying to remember who he was